  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¿Sabes qué es lo más importante en un combate\nPokémon?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0053006100620065007300200071007500E90020006500730020006C006F0020006D00E1007300200069006D0070006F007200740061006E0074006500200065006E00200075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E003F00100002011401E70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡El Ataque!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006C002000410074006100710075006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡La Defensa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C006100200044006500660065006E0073006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡La estrategia!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C00610020006500730074007200610074006500670069006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡La suerte!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C0061002000730075006500720074006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Para nada!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100500061007200610020006E006100640061002100100002011401E70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te lo voy a revelar. Lo más importante es...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400650020006C006F00200076006F00790020006100200072006500760065006C00610072002E0020004C006F0020006D00E1007300200069006D0070006F007200740061006E00740065002000650073002E002E002E00100002011401E70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Desplazarse rápido!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10044006500730070006C0061007A00610072007300650020007200E1007000690064006F002100100002011401E70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Es un pilar básico en los combates, hazme caso!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTe permite acortar distancias en un instante y\ntambién esquivar los movimientos enemigos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por eso mis Cyclizar y yo corremos todos los días\npor Ciudad Luminalia, y así aprendieron<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nun movimiento que los hace aún más rápidos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "O sea que se mueven a toda velocidad, ¡y no hay\nquien les pueda poner la mano encima!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cyyy!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004300790079007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cliii!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006C00690069006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Zaaar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005A006100610061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si dudas de mi palabra, ¡comprobémoslo\nen un combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006400750064006100730020006400650020006D0069002000700061006C0061006200720061002C002000A10063006F006D00700072006F006200E9006D006F0073006C006F000A0065006E00200075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065002100100002011401E70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En cuanto hayas realizado los preparativos\nnecesarios, avísame.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
